      "body": "With the following:\n\n>  ./configure --with-undefined-behavior-sanitizer --prefix=\"$(pwd)/build\" CC=clang LD=clang CFLAGS=\"-fsanitize=undefined -fno-sanitize-recover -Wno-unused-function\"  LDFLAGS=\"-fsanitize=undefined -fno-sanitize-recover\" -q --with-pydebug\n\nI'm actually getting a crash:\n\n> test_nommap_no_crash (test.test_dbm_gnu.TestGdbm.test_nommap_no_crash) ... gdbm fatal: Unexpected end of file\n\nI haven't looked at the code to see whether this is my issue or if something is weird with UBSan.",
